<QuestionLayout
  title="What is one shared runtime.wasm in Traverse?"
  description="One shared runtime.wasm; browser, native, CLI, and MCP are clients. Honest consumers: JS/TS, Rust, MCP published; Python via CLI; Swift/Kotlin/.NET published, pre-1.0, not Certified."
